      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "LiteRT-LM is an open-source inference engine designed to efficiently run large language models on resource-constrained edge devices like smartphones and IoT hardware. It achieves this through specialized kernel optimizations and memory management techniques that reduce computational overhead while maintaining model accuracy. Developers can integrate it into mobile applications or embedded systems to enable on-device AI capabilities without cloud dependency, making it ideal for privacy-sensitive or latency-critical use cases.",
        "zh": "LiteRT-LM是一个专为边缘计算设计的开源推理引擎，能够在手机、物联网设备等资源受限的硬件上高效运行大语言模型。其核心技术在于针对边缘场景优化的计算内核和内存管理机制，通过算子融合和量化策略在保持精度的同时大幅降低计算开销。开发者可将其集成到移动应用或嵌入式系统中，实现无需云端依赖的本地AI功能，特别适用于隐私保护要求高或需要实时响应的场景，如离线语音助手、智能摄像头分析等。",
        "es": "LiteRT-LM is an open-source inference engine designed to efficiently run large language models on resource-constrained edge devices like smartphones and IoT hardware. It achieves this through specialized kernel optimizations and memory management techniques that reduce computational overhead while maintaining model accuracy. Developers can integrate it into mobile applications or embedded systems to enable on-device AI capabilities without cloud dependency, making it ideal for privacy-sensitive or latency-critical use cases.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "LiteRT-LM gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "LiteRT-LM is an open-source inference engine designed to efficiently run large language models on resource-constrained edge devices like smartphones and IoT hardware. It achieves this through specialized kernel optimizations and memory management techniques that reduce computational overhead while maintaining model accuracy. Developers can integrate it into mobile applications or embedded systems to enable on-device AI capabilities without cloud dependency, making it ideal for privacy-sensitive or latency-critical use cases.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
